<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Brilliant</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>

<body class="order">
    <header>
        <h1>The brilliant printers</h1>
    </header>
    <main class="content">
        <div>
            <p>Now that you are a teacher, you can provide the name of your school and the country that you come from.
                Items that contain * do not skip them. Fill in the smal form and submit</p>
            <p>Remember no order will be taken without paying the prices for exams. The teachers exam price are given by
                authority and direct contact through signing in</p>
        </div>

        <% if (typeof success !== 'undefined' && success) { %>
            <div class="success-banner">
                Your order has been successfully saved! We will get back to you soon.
            </div>
         <% } %>

        <div class="order-form">
            <form action="/order" method="POST">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="school"><span class="red">*</span>Name of School</label>
                    <input type="text" id="school" name="school" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="county"><span class="red">*</span>County</label>
                    <input type="text" id="county" name="county" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="village"><span class="red">*</span>Name of Village</label>
                    <input type="text" id="village" name="village" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="email"><span class="red">*</span>Email</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group textarea-group">
                    <label for="message"><span class="red">*</span>Write your order message</label>
                    <textarea name="message" id="message" rows="4" required></textarea>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <input type="submit" value="Submit">
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </main>
    <footer>
        <div>
            <div class="link-footer">
                <a href="/">HOME</a>
                <a href="/order">ORDER</a>
                <a href="/contact">CONTACT</a>
                <a href="/compensation">COMPENSATION</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <marquee direction="left">
            The Brilliant Printers is a company that started long time ago and is ready to serve everybody It listens to
            everybody. Contact us on zawadisindani@gmail.com or you can call us on 0704759872
        </marquee>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>